    "study.proximos.passos-que-eu-daria": "Steps I would take next",
    "study.proximos.validar-a-hipotese-do": "Validate the problem hypothesis with interviews and usability testing with students.",
    "study.proximos.validar-o-login-no": "Validate sign-in on the server and create accounts, to sync data across devices.",
