    "cc.r.metodo.metodo": "Method",
    "cc.r.metodo.metodo-v": "Heuristic evaluation: I went through the current app’s screens using Nielsen’s 10 heuristics and logged each friction point in one of four categories. Then a qualitative benchmark of 8 apps and a synthesis in an insights map.",
    "cc.r.metodo.gravidade": "Severity",
