    "cc.r.decisoes.nomenclatura-intro": "The Figma file and the boards used different names for the same thing. I settled on the terms below for the case study and the prototype fixes. The rule: <strong>Ingressos</strong> (Tickets) is the place where purchased tickets live; <strong>compra</strong> (purchase) is the action and the flow of paying. That way the bar doesn’t repeat the Comprar/Compras confusion the audit found in the current app.",
